Create a complete, colourful and modern *NutriMatrix AI-powered nutrition and smart grocery website using React.js*.

### Main Requirement

Build the website as a multi-page React.js application with proper navigation and working button events.

The user flow must be exactly:

*Welcome Page → Register Page → Login Page → Home Page*

### 1. Welcome Page

Create an attractive landing/welcome page for NutriMatrix.

Include:

* NutriMatrix logo/name
* A colourful, fresh and premium food/nutrition theme
* Main heading: *“Make Every Choice Count.”*
* Description: *“Your AI-powered nutrition companion for smarter grocery decisions, healthier alternatives and better food choices.”*
* Attractive images/illustrations of fruits, vegetables and healthy groceries
* Feature highlights such as:

  * AI Nutrition Analysis
  * Healthy Alternatives
  * Digital Pantry
  * Expiry Reminders
  * Smart Recommendations
* A prominent *“Get Started”* button

*Get Started button functionality:*
When clicked, navigate to the *Register Page*.

### 2. Register Page

Create a colourful registration page.

Fields:

* Full Name
* Email
* Password
* Confirm Password

Include:

* Password visibility eye icon
* Password validation
* Confirm password validation
* Attractive NutriMatrix styling
* “Create Account” button
* Link: *“Already have an account? Login”*

*Functionality:*
When the user successfully creates an account:

1. Validate all fields.
2. Store the registration information using browser localStorage for demonstration.
3. Display a success message such as *“Account created successfully!”*
4. Automatically redirect the user to the *Login Page*.

If the user clicks *Login*, navigate directly to the Login Page.

### 3. Login Page

Create a modern colourful login page matching the Register Page.

Fields:

* Email
* Password
* Password visibility eye icon

Include:

* *Login* button
* “Don't have an account? Register” link
* Proper validation
* Friendly error message for incorrect login details

*Functionality:*
Check the credentials stored during registration.

When login is successful:

1. Display a short success message.
2. Redirect the user to the *Home Page*.

### 4. Home Page

Create a beautiful NutriMatrix dashboard/home page after successful login.

Include:

* Navigation bar
* NutriMatrix logo
* Home
* About Us
* Nutrition
* Pantry
* Recommendations
* Profile
* Logout

Hero section:

* Greeting such as *“Welcome to NutriMatrix”*
* Short description about making smarter and healthier grocery choices
* Colourful grocery/food imagery

Create attractive feature cards/sections for:

* *Nutrition Analysis* – Analyze nutritional information of grocery products.
* *Healthy Alternatives* – Suggest healthier alternatives.
* *Digital Pantry* – Track grocery items stored by the user.
* *Expiry Reminders* – Help users keep track of expiry dates.
* *AI Recommendations* – Provide personalized food and nutrition recommendations.

Important:
*NutriMatrix is NOT an online shopping/e-commerce website.*
Do NOT add:

* Payment
* Checkout
* Online purchasing
* Product selling
* Shopping cart for purchasing

The project is focused on *nutrition analysis, grocery management, healthier choices and AI-based recommendations*.

### Design Requirements

Make the website visually rich and colourful.

Use:

* Fresh green as the primary colour
* Light green
* White
* Yellow/orange accents
* Soft gradients
* Rounded cards
* Modern typography
* Subtle shadows
* Glassmorphism where appropriate
* Smooth hover effects
* Clean spacing
* Responsive design for desktop, tablet and mobile
* Attractive fruit, vegetable and grocery visuals

Do NOT make the website mostly white or blank.

Images should be properly integrated into the design instead of appearing as random pasted images.

