### Logout

Add a working *Logout* button on the Home Page.

When Logout is clicked:

* Remove the logged-in state from localStorage.
* Redirect the user to the Login Page.

### Important

Do not create a static UI only.

All buttons, navigation links, registration, login, logout, password visibility and redirects must actually work.

Provide the *complete runnable React.js project code*, including all required files, CSS and installation/run instructions.

The final result should look like a polished *NutriMatrix AI nutrition platform*, not a generic template.